            <ArticleTitle>Diagnosis of functional neurological disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>373-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Functional disease is a common and difficult problem in clinical neurology. A thorough appraisal should be undertaken before concluding that a patient's problem is not physically based. This article describes symptoms and signs of potential value in the diagnosis of such disorder.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
